# Queen Brahne {2}{R}, 2/1, prowess. "Whenever Queen Brahne attacks, create a 0/1 black Wizard creature token with 'Whenever you cast a
# noncreature spell, this token deals 1 damage to each opponent.'" (CR 508.1m, 111.1). Cast on turn 1 there is no Wizard yet. Attacking
# on turn 3 makes exactly one, untapped and not attacking, and Brahne deals 2 unblocked (Bot2 20 to 18). After combat Mox Sapphire,
# a noncreature spell, pumps Brahne to 3/2 with prowess (CR 702.108a) and makes the Wizard deal 1 to Bot2 (18 to 17).

